<title>FRANCE: Firebomb hits Societe Generale office in Marseille.</title>
<headline>Firebomb hits Societe Generale office in Marseille.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A booby-trapped parcel blew up in front of a branch office of the Societe Generale bank in the Mediterranean port city of Marseille late on Friday, slightly injuring two people, emergency workers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was apparently an explosion of criminal origin,&quot; a spokesman for the Marseille fire department said.</p>
<p>The building was only slightly damaged.</p>
</text>
